<a name="database"/><h1>Database Configuration</h1>

<p>SQL Relay can be configured to connect to a wide variety of databases.</p>

<ul>
  <li><a href="oracleconfiguration.html#db-oracle">Oracle</a></li>
  <li><a href="mssqlodbcconfiguration.html#db-mssql-odbc">Microsoft SQL Server (via ODBC)</a></li>
  <li><a href="mssqlfreetdsconfiguration.html#db-mssql-freetds">Microsoft SQL Server (via FreeTDS)</a></li>
  <li><a href="sapconfiguration.html#db-sap">SAP/Sybase (via the native SAP/Sybase library)</a></li>
  <li><a href="sapfreetdsconfiguration.html#db-sap-freetds">SAP/Sybase (via FreeTDS)</a></li>
  <li><a href="db2configuration.html#db-db2">IBM DB2</a></li>
  <li><a href="informixconfiguration.html#db-informix">Informix</a></li>
  <li><a href="mysqlconfiguration.html#db-mysql">MySQL/MariaDB</a></li>
  <li><a href="postgresqlconfiguration.html#db-postgresql">PostgreSQL</a></li>
  <li><a href="firebirdconfiguration.html#db-firebird">Firebird</a></li>
  <li><a href="sqliteconfiguration.html#db-sqlite">SQLite</a></li>
  <li><a href="teradataconfiguration.html#db-odbc-teradata">Teradata (via ODBC)</a></li>
  <li><a href="exasolconfiguration.html#db-odbc-exasol">Exasol (via ODBC)</a></li>
  <li><a href="hiveconfiguration.html#db-odbc-hive">Apache Hive (via ODBC)</a></li>
  <li><a href="impalaconfiguration.html#db-odbc-impala">Apache Impala (via ODBC)</a></li>
  <li><a href="redshiftodbcconfiguration.html#db-odbc-redshift">Amazon Redshift (via ODBC)</a></li>
  <li><a href="redshiftpostgresqlconfiguration.html#db-postgresql-redshift">Amazon Redshift (via PostgreSQL)</a></li>
  <li><a href="athenaconfiguration.html#db-odbc-athena">Amazon Athena (via ODBC)</a></li>
  <li><a href="odbcconfiguration.html#db-odbc">Generic ODBC</a></li>
</ul>

